               Diff
               n               Next hunk
               N p             Previous hunk
               Enter o         Expand folded lines
               j ↓             Down a line
               k ↑             Up a line
               C-d             Down half a page
               C-u             Up half a page
               PgDn C-f Space  Down a page
               PgUp            Up a page
               g Home          Top of the file
               G End           Bottom of the file
               h ←             Scroll left
               l →             Scroll right

               View
               s               Split or unified
               w               Wrap long lines
               z               Fold unchanged lines
